<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/sdg_12_10"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2017-11-06</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Gefahrenklasse</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Hazard class</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Classe de dangerosité</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Umweltindikator</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Environment indicator</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Indicateur de l&apos;environnement</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Consumption of chemicals by hazardousness - EU aggregate</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">This indicator measures the volume of aggregated consumption of toxic chemicals, expressed in million tonnes. The consumption of chemicals is calculated as the sum of the production volumes (PRODCOM) and the net import volumes of the chemicals (COMEXT) according to the equation: Consumption = production + imports – exports. The data on hazardous and non-hazardous chemicals show the total consumption of all chemicals. The two sub-categories of hazardous chemicals – hazardous to human health and hazardous to the environment – overlap by definition and as a result their sum is not equal to the total consumption of hazardous chemicals.</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Consommation de substances chimiques par dangerosité - UE agrégat</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">Cet indicateur mesure le volume de la consommation agrégée de produits chimiques toxiques, exprimée en millions de tonnes. La consommation de produits chimiques est calculée en additionnant les volumes de production (PRODCOM) et les volumes d’importation nets des produits chimiques (COMEXT) selon l’équation suivante: Consommation = production + importations — exportations. Les données sur les produits chimiques dangereux et non dangereux font apparaître la consommation totale de toutes les substances chimiques. Les deux sous-catégories de substances chimiques dangereuses — dangereuses pour la santé humaine et dangereuses pour l’environnement — se recoupent par définition et leur somme n’est donc pas égale à la consommation totale de produits chimiques dangereux.</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Konsum von Chemikalien nach Gefährlichkeit - EU Aggregat</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">Dieser Indikator misst das Volumen des aggregierten Verbrauchs toxischer Chemikalien, ausgedrückt in Millionen Tonnen. Der Verbrauch von Chemikalien wird berechnet als Summe der Produktionsmengen (PRODCOM) und der Nettoeinfuhrmengen der Chemikalien (COMEXT) nach folgender Gleichung: Verbrauch = Produktion + Einfuhren – Ausfuhren. Die Daten über gefährliche und ungefährliche Chemikalien zeigen den Gesamtverbrauch aller Chemikalien. Die beiden Unterkategorien gefährlicher Chemikalien – gefährlich für die menschliche Gesundheit und umweltgefährlich – überschneiden sich definitionsgemäß, so dass ihre Summe nicht dem Gesamtverbrauch gefährlicher Chemikalien entspricht.</dct:description><dct:identifier>sdg_12_10</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/sdg_12_10"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EUR"/></dct:spatial><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/FREQ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Time frequency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/GEO" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/HAZARD" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Gefahrenklasse</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Hazard class</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Classe de dangerosité</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_ENV" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Umweltindikator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Environment indicator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Indicateur de l&apos;environnement</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/OBS_FLAG" /> </stat:attribute><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CONF_STATUS" /> </stat:attribute><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_ENV?code=CONS"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Konsum von Chemikalien</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Consumption of chemicals</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Consommation de substances chimiques</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=MIO_T"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Millionen Tonnen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Million tonnes</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Millions de tonnes</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:numSeries rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</stat:numSeries><dcat:theme><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER" /></dcat:theme><dcat:theme><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENVI" /></dcat:theme><dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-12-12</dct:modified><dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:Frequency rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"/></dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:temporal><dct:PeriodOfTime rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime/3169a64b-f3b3-4920-b709-b32c20b97678"><dcat:startDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2004-01-01</dcat:startDate><dcat:endDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2023-12-31</dcat:endDate></dct:PeriodOfTime></dct:temporal><dct:accessRights><dct:RightsStatement rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/></dct:accessRights><dcat:landingPage><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/sdg_12_10"><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/WEBPAGE_RELATED"/><schema:url xml:lang="en">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/sdg_12_10</schema:url><dct:title xml:lang="en">More information on Eurostat Website</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Plus d&apos;information sur le site web d&apos;Eurostat</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="de">Mehr Informationen auf der Eurostat Website</dct:title></foaf:Document></dcat:landingPage><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/sdg_12_10_esmsip2.htm"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) HTML</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/sdg_12_10"